@startuml
title ASII-08 - Componentes ANTES (Alternativa B: Services con Eloquent directo)

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

package "Presentation" {
    component TransferController
    component DischargeController
}

package "Application" {
    component TransferPatientService
    component DischargePatientService
}

package "Infrastructure (Eloquent)" {
    component "Admission (Eloquent Model)" as AdmissionModel
    component "Bed (Eloquent Model)" as BedModel
    component "BedTransfer (Eloquent Model)" as BedTransferModel
    component "DB::transaction()" as DBFacade
}

database PostgreSQL

TransferController --> TransferPatientService
DischargeController --> DischargePatientService

TransferPatientService ..> AdmissionModel : consulta/actualiza\ndirectamente
TransferPatientService ..> BedModel : consulta/actualiza\ndirectamente
TransferPatientService ..> BedTransferModel : crea\ndirectamente
TransferPatientService ..> DBFacade : depende del\nfacade concreto

DischargePatientService ..> AdmissionModel : consulta/actualiza\ndirectamente
DischargePatientService ..> BedModel : consulta/actualiza\ndirectamente
DischargePatientService ..> DBFacade

AdmissionModel --> PostgreSQL
BedModel --> PostgreSQL
BedTransferModel --> PostgreSQL

note bottom
Alto acoplamiento: Application conoce Eloquent y SQL directamente.
No hay contrato intermedio - imposible sustituir la persistencia
o usar dobles de prueba sin arrancar Eloquent real.
end note

@enduml
